From 0b456a1c2aa0c6c5fbebad945533d6d8611650d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elieaazzam-art <elieaazzam-art@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 10:43:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(client): the rodio audio backend joins the client
 (A-100, PLAN-M10.2 4.1)

The Phase 4 dependency: rodio 0.22.2 (playback feature only - the
decoders and the noise/rand machinery stay off; every sound this pass
makes is synthesized PCM). The allow-list amendment rides in the same
commit per the plan's global rules, and ADR-0002 records the choice,
the resolved version, and the feature trim with the alternatives
considered. A-119 registers the owner's Phase 4 go (2026-10-08).

No code uses it yet - the next commits build the sink behind the
existing engine seam.
